{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201230","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1820123001:0":{"text":"샤베린, 오랜만이야!","source_cn":"莎柏琳，好久不见啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38656F8688679BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820123002:1":{"text":"요즘 대체 뭘 하고 지내는 거야? 당최 머리를 짚고 아무리 고민해 봐도 감이 안 잡히더라니까.","source_cn":"你最近都忙什么呢？真让我摸不着头脑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B2B31CC75D7B0AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820123003:0":{"text":"그래서 생각하고 또 생각하고 있는데... 갑자기 목덜미가 엄청나게 서늘한 거 있지?","source_cn":"然后我想啊想啊，想啊想啊——这时候，我突然发现，我的脖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDFFA7E3F225974C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820123004:0":{"text":"그래서 위쪽을 더듬어 봤더니...","source_cn":"往上一摸，我发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76454DA8A9D76BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820123005:1":{"text":"진짜로 머리가 떨어져 있었지 뭐야! 이번엔 정말 <style=\"highlight\">머리를 짚을 수가</style> 없더라고! 하하하하!","source_cn":"我的头真的掉了！这次，我是真的<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDA96EB78E2CBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820123006:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820123007:0":{"text":"하하! 놀랐어? 그렇게 겁먹지 마! 이렇게 다시 붙였잖아?","source_cn":"哈哈！吓到了吗？别这么胆小！我这不是把头安回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE65ECD26A68A2218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820123008:0":{"text":"잠깐! 나도 있어, 나도 웃긴 얘기 할래!","source_cn":"等等！我也有，我也有笑话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C192C5BCB793C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820123009:0":{"text":"어느 날 갑자기 내 정강이뼈 한 마디가 사라진 거야. 큰일이지, 사코프보다 머리 하나만큼 작아졌으니까!","source_cn":"有一天，我发现我的小腿骨突然少了一节。这可麻烦了，我比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D68C71628329BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820123010:0":{"text":"혹시 내가 그것 때문에 사코프보다 작은 거라는 말을 너희가 안 믿고 그냥 핑계라고 생각하면 어떡하겠어?","source_cn":"万一你们不相信我是因为这个才比死考夫矮的，以为我是在找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA3598354E8184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820123011:0":{"text":"그래서 생각해 낸 게...","source_cn":"所以，我也想了个好办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AC83D5CEFD5440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820123012:0":{"text":"아예 해골이 되는 거였어! 하하하하! 근데 원래대로 돌아갈 수가 없더라고!","source_cn":"——那就是把自己变成骷髅！啊哈哈哈！可惜，我变不回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590796C559FFF107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820123013:0":{"text":"어때, 정말 아쉽지? 아가씨, 네 살가죽 좀 빌려주지 않을래?","source_cn":"你说，是不是很可惜？小姑娘，把你的皮肉借给我好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB3A8DCD7E04DE5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820123014:0":{"text":"<shk>그, 그게...</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>你、你们——</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A01D6207491982E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820123015:0":{"text":"자, 또다시 세상과 영원히 작별하고 싶은 게 아니라면 이제 장난은 그만해.","source_cn":"好了，不要再胡闹了。除非你们打算再次和世界永别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27396AAADF55845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820123016:0":{"text":"알았어, 알았어... 진지해진 샤베린은 정말 무섭다니까!","source_cn":"好啦好啦……严肃起来的莎柏琳真可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A48BC83F8848CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1820123017:1":{"text":"긴장하지 마. 늘 저런 식으로 남을 놀라게 하며 즐기거든. 천천히 익숙해지면 돼.","source_cn":"别紧张，他们总爱做这种事，靠吓唬人来找乐子，慢慢习惯就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D39C882839166B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1820123018:1":{"text":"정말 너무 심하게 굴면... 들고 있는 신체 부위를 빼앗아서 두들겨 패 버려.","source_cn":"如果他们真的太过分了——去把他们手里的肢体抢下来，狠狠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB9EA8B26199305B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1820123019:1":{"text":"보통은 그렇게 하면 바로 얌전해지거든.","source_cn":"通常在第一步，他们就会学乖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA34C1FA304431251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:死考夫":{"text":"사코프","source":"死考夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"비비아","source":"薇薇娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:金姆":{"text":"짐","source":"金姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莎柏琳":{"text":"샤베린","source":"莎柏琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":4}}